OL,3,GNEWSAMurder investigation after four
OL,4,Apeople die in arson attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder investigation has begun after
OL,7,Ffour people, including two children,
OL,8,Fdied in an arson attack on a family
OL,9,Fhome in County Waterford.
OL,11,FGardai (Irish police) confirmed that a
OL,12,Fman, a woman and two of their children
OL,13,Fdied in the fire at a house on Birch
OL,14,FAvenue, on the outskirts of Waterford
OL,15,Fcity.
OL,17,FTwo more of their children were
OL,18,Fcritically injured as a result of the
OL,19,Fblaze which was reported shortly after
OL,20,F05:00 local time on Tuesday. They are
OL,21,Fboth in hospital in Dublin.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
