OL,3,GNEWSAMurder investigation after four
OL,4,Apeople die in arson attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FCh Supt Anthony Pettit told reporters
OL,7,Fthat officers believe the house "was
OL,8,Fattacked by a person or persons unknown
OL,9,Fand that the fire was started
OL,10,Fdeliberately".
